WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
And most of them are built in China,

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.040
and I give China a lot of credit.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.120
They build them, but they have very few wind farms.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.560
So, why is it that they build them

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.080
and they send them all over the world?

